{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 14,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Lamb Takes the Scroll"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I saw in the right "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "hand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Him who sat on the throne a scroll written inside and on the back, sealed with seven seals. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I saw a strong angel proclaiming with a loud voice, “Who is worthy to open the scroll and to loose its seals?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And no one in heaven or on the earth or under the earth was able to open the scroll, or to look at it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So I wept much, because no one was found worthy to open "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit and read"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and read the scroll, or to look at it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But one of the elders said to me, “Do not weep. Behold, the Lion of the tribe of Judah, the Root of David, has prevailed to open the scroll and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit to loose"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to loose its seven seals.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I looked, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M I saw in the midst . . . a Lamb standing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and behold, in the midst of the throne and of the four living creatures, and in the midst of the elders, stood a Lamb as though it had been slain, having seven horns and seven eyes, which are the seven Spirits of God sent out into all the earth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He came and took the scroll out of the right hand of Him who sat on the throne."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Worthy Is the Lamb"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when He had taken the scroll, the four living creatures and the twenty-four elders fell down before the Lamb, each having a harp, and golden bowls full of incense, which are the prayers of the saints. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they sang a new song, saying:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“You are worthy to take the scroll,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And to open its seals;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For You were slain,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And have redeemed us to God by Your blood"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Out of every tribe and tongue and people and nation,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And have made "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "us kings"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU a kingdom"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and priests to our God;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M they"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "we shall reign on the earth.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I looked, and I heard the voice of many angels around the throne, the living creatures, and the elders; and the number of them was ten thousand times ten thousand, and thousands of thousands, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying with a loud voice:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Worthy is the Lamb who was slain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To receive power and riches and wisdom,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And strength and honor and glory and blessing!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And every creature which is in heaven and on the earth and under the earth and such as are in the sea, and all that are in them, I heard saying:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Blessing and honor and glory and power"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Him who sits on the throne,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And to the Lamb, forever and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M adds Amen"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "ever!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the four living creatures said, “Amen!” And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit twenty-four"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "twenty-four elders fell down and worshiped "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit Him who lives forever and ever"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Him who lives forever and ever."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}